---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service — viralNest" description="Terms of Service for viralNest Pinterest Downloader.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-8 text-left bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-sm">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-4">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-6">Last updated: July 23, 2026</p>
    
    <div class="prose max-w-none text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-4 font-medium">
      <p>By accessing or using viralNest (https://viralnest.com), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">1. Permitted Use</h2>
      <p>viralNest provides media extraction tools for public Pinterest pins. Users agree to use viralNest strictly for lawful, personal, non-commercial, or authorized content archiving purposes.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">2. Copyright and Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>viralNest does not own, host, or claim copyright over any media files downloaded through our tool. All intellectual property, trademarks, and media assets belong to their respective original creators and platform rights holders.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">3. Limitation of Liability</h2>
